    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. thats a good start. i'm mostly worried about the \"edge cases\" though. like, how do we make sure we catch the small glitches or accessibility issues that aren't obvious during a standard design review? any tips for uncovering those hidden stuff before we launch?",
