      "content": "To catch edge cases in mobile apps, conduct rigorous automated and manual testing specifically on various devices with different OS build versions where rendering engines may behave uniquely. You should perform sessions using real screen readers like VoiceOver and TalkBack while simulating real-world impairments such as low-vision modes, zooming, and full-range contrast. Finally, involve actual users from diverse backgrounds during beta testing to expose interaction patterns you might miss in controlled environments.",
